hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1045","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Allah ke raste mein ghode par sawari karayi. Phir jis ke paas tha us ne use zaya kiya. Phir main ne irada kiya ke use khareedun. Aur main ne gumaan kiya ke wo use sasta bechega. Phir main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Na khareedo aur apne sadqe mein na lauto, agarche wo tumhe dirham mein de. Kyunke apne sadqe mein lautne wala qay mein lautne wale jaisa hai."
"1046","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin al-Khattab ne Allah ke raste mein ghode par sawari karayi. Phir use bikte paya. Phir irada kiya ke use khareedein. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Use na khareedo aur apne sadqe mein na lauto."
"1047","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne hadiye mein lautne wala kutte jaisa hai jo qay kare phir apni qay mein laute."
"1048","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un ke walid unhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laye. Phir unhon ne arz kiya: Beshak main ne apne is bete ko ghulam hadiya kiya hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apni tamam aulad ko is jaisa hadiya kiya hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir use lauta lo."
"1049","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir se Amir ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nu'man bin Bashir ko mimbar par kehte suna: Mere walid ne mujhe atiya diya. Phir Amra bint Rawaha ne kaha: Main raazi nahi yahan tak ke tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko gawah banao. Phir wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye. Phir unhon ne arz kiya: Beshak main ne apne bete ko Amra bint Rawaha se atiya diya hai. Phir unhon ne mujhe hukm diya ke tumhe gawah banaun Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apni baqi aulad ko is jaisa diya hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir Allah se daro aur apni aulad ke darmiyan insaf karo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo laute aur apna atiya lautaya."
"1050","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne umra ka faisla farmaya ke wo us ke liye hai jise hadiya kiya gaya."
"1051","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Umra jayez hai."
